	(text "CDP1861 GRAPHICS: DISPLAY ON/OFF, DMA, COMPOSITE VIDEO, RIBBON TO THE CPU CARD" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "99a4102b-82d2-5430-bf54-ef16d9193fa3"))
	(text "The 1861 needs the CPU clock (LCLK), SC0/SC1, DMA OUT and its EF line: they come over the SV3 ribbon from the CPU card.\nWith a port on SV6, INP = DISPLAY ON, OUT = DISPLAY OFF (IC16); IC2 remembers it for LED4. -INT goes to the bus.\nVIDEO and SYNC mix through R13/R14/R15 to the RCA jack. Not used on Ken's card (SV6 empty)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a77ea66f-7aa5-5353-b330-d1ec4f88d9c4"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
